{"v":4,"catch":"閃避車流，活得更久。","desc":"Traffic Survivor 是一款節奏快速的無盡跑酷遊戲，在高速公路上的每一秒都可能是最後一秒。穿梭於密集車流之中，閃避卡車與轎車，避開路障，並即時應對不斷變化的各種危險。熟練掌握奔跑、跳躍、滑行與加速，面對愈來愈快、愈來愈難、也愈來愈混亂的道路挑戰。你能存活多久？","publisher":"Gametry","release":"2026-07-23","genres":["競速","動作","街機","模擬"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["英文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"普遍級","size":"Switch 2 0.7GB / Switch 0.7GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/e66480fab817e1f3d536bec1def1077dcd42aca30f35125e16ad41c33130f2d5.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/a462a50cf905a9859ad69a30091d67b223e287b3c3be5cc1f5ecbef89a27cb8e.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/95218e3f884507605b0d1a9ff97c86ad189d511c4fd472b14d571cb12225d1be.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/63b551b8bed910da1c642a07a04d34bd24fb969449927bcdbe0847ad71568cc7.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/46647f7e63397f3d8ee4f70a089c98c02114a6b9c6601cf4ccec9d7dd21cbed2.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/b6ba3191a5ae7df788cb835493d65fbc6628060bbe5440be5a4e0394f2738a17.jpg"],"titleId":"0100cdb0286aa000","dlc":[]}